# Sveltia CMS

Live `/admin/` uses GitHub OAuth via `auth.rednaw.nl`. iac `ALLOWED_DOMAINS` includes `rednaw.github.io`. Add `anticobagliosiciliano.it` at cutover (`.cursor/plans/domain-cutover-seo.md`). Do not invent a parallel auth.

## Must preserve

- Pin `@sveltia/cms` in `package.json` (exact version). Kit route `src/routes/(cms)/admin/` (`ssr = false`) `import`s the package; Vite bundles hashed chunks under `SITE_BASE`. Config is TypeScript `CmsConfig` in `src/lib/cms-config.ts` via `CMS.init({ config: { load_config_file: false, ... } })` — no `config.yml`, no copied IIFE, no unpkg. Renovate npm (`groupName: sveltia cms`); merge only after checking release notes — no automerge.
- Backend: GitHub `rednaw/anticobagliosiciliano`, `skip_ci: false`, `base_url: https://auth.rednaw.nl`, `auth_methods: [oauth]`. No client secret in this repo. Do not add `/admin` to the public nav. Admin HTML is `noindex` (hooks inject it into the `ssr = false` shell; layout also sets it after hydrate). Local login is still Local Repository. Route group `(cms)` keeps a minimal layout (no `app.css` / site fonts). `trailingSlash: always` covers `/admin/`. Hooks strip site CSP on `/admin/` — both the meta tag (prerender/Pages) and the response header (Vite dev) — so CMS fonts (jsDelivr Material Symbols), GitHub API, and OAuth can run. Public pages keep hashed CSP. Hooks also strip Umami + Simple Analytics from `/admin/` (CMS must not appear in public dashboards).
- Collections write `src/content/<collection.name>/` YAML (files `src/content/<collection.name>/<file.name>.yml`). Places `create: false` / `delete: false` / `thumbnail: false`. Houses are an explicit files list (`casa-1`…`casa-4` then `chrome`; no folder create). Include every YAML key (hidden/collapsed for slug, capacity, coords) so a save cannot drop fields. CMS field order matches YAML key order.
- YAML is per-field `{ it, en }`. Do not enable Sveltia `i18n` (`single_file` is top-level locale keys and empties the collections). Localized fields are object widgets with `it` / `en`.
- `media_folder: static/images` + `public_folder: /images`. File/collection media paths are repo-root (`/static/images/…`, `/images/…`) so the image picker scopes File Assets to that folder. `asset_collections` (Home, Premi, Come arrivare, Casa 1–4, Luoghi) are the named folders in Select Image. JPEG/PNG land under houses `casa-N`, places, awards, ambiance, arrive. Build emits WebP.
